\begin{MintedVerbatim}[commandchars=\\\{\}]
\PYG{g+gi}{+ /\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} An exact covering of a group `G` is a finite collection of subgroups}
\PYG{g+gi}{+ `\PYGZob{}H\PYGZus{}1, ..., H\PYGZus{}k\PYGZcb{}` and representative `\PYGZob{}g\PYGZus{}1, ..., g\PYGZus{}k\PYGZcb{}` such that the}
\PYG{g+gi}{+ cosets `g\PYGZus{}iH\PYGZus{}i` are pairwise disjoint and their union covers `G`.}
\PYG{g+gi}{+}
\PYG{g+gi}{+ Note that this differs from `Partition (α := Subgroup G)` because the}
\PYG{g+gi}{+ covering condition there invokes `Subgroup.sup` which is subgroup generation}
\PYG{g+gi}{+ and thus stronger than union. This definition is easier to use in this}
\PYG{g+gi}{+ context than the alternative `Partition (α := Set G)`, which lacks}
\PYG{g+gi}{+ subgroup definitions such as `Subgroup.index`. \PYGZhy{}/}
\PYG{g+gi}{+ structure Group.ExactCovering (G : Type*) [Group G] (ι : Type*) [Fintype ι] where}
\PYG{g+gi}{+   parts : ι → Subgroup G}
\PYG{g+gi}{+   reps : ι → G}
\PYG{g+gi}{+   nonempty (i : ι) : (parts i : Set G).Nonempty}
\PYG{g+gi}{+   disjoint : (Set.univ (α := ι)).PairwiseDisjoint}
\PYG{g+gi}{+     fun (i : ι) ↦ reps i • (parts i : Set G)}
\PYG{g+gi}{+   covers : ⋃ i, reps i • (parts i : Set G) = Set.univ}

\PYG{+w}{ } /\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}
\PYG{+w}{ } If `G` is a group then can there exist an exact covering of `G` by more than
\PYG{+w}{ } one cosets of different sizes? (i.e. each element is contained in exactly
\PYG{+w}{ } one of the cosets.)
\PYG{+w}{ } \PYGZhy{}/
\PYG{+w}{ } @[category research open, AMS 20]
\PYG{+w}{ } theorem erdos\PYGZus{}274 (G : Type*) [Group G] (hG : 1 \PYGZlt{} ENat.card G) :
\PYG{g+gd}{\PYGZhy{}     (∃ (P : Partition (⊤ : Subgroup G)),}
\PYG{g+gd}{\PYGZhy{}       1 \PYGZlt{} P.parts.ncard ∧}
\PYG{g+gd}{\PYGZhy{}       (∀ A ∈ P.parts, ∃ᵉ (s : G) (H : Subgroup G), s • (H : Set G) = A) ∧}
\PYG{g+gd}{\PYGZhy{}       P.parts.Pairwise fun A B ↦ \PYGZsh{}A ≠ \PYGZsh{}B) ↔ answer(sorry) := by}
\PYG{g+gi}{+     (∃ (ι : Type*) (\PYGZus{} : Fintype ι) (P : Group.ExactCovering G ι),}
\PYG{g+gi}{+       1 \PYGZlt{} Fintype.card ι ∧ (Set.range P.parts).Pairwise fun A B ↦ \PYGZsh{}A ≠ \PYGZsh{}B) ↔}
\PYG{g+gi}{+         answer(sorry) := by}
\PYG{+w}{ } sorry
\end{MintedVerbatim}
